es\"><h2 id=\"notes\">Notes</h2><ul><li>Figures are whole dollars as the book prints them.</li><li>The book prints four columns: 2023-24 Actual, 2024-25 Estimated, 2025-26 Recommended and 2025-26 Adopted by the Board of Supervisors.</li><li>In the data, Actual is an executed budget, Estimated an adjusted one, Recommended a proposed one and Adopted an approved one; schemaGov has no estimated phase.</li><li>These figures are kept apart from the FY 2026-28 book, which also prints FY 2025-26 (as Approved).</li><li>Budget lines on this page are the book's Schedule 8: each budget unit under the function and activity it is listed in.</li><li>106 fund numbers in Schedule 2 were not in the funds data and were added with the book's name and number.</li></ul><div class=\"table-block\" id=\"totals-that-differ-from-their-parts-as-printed-10sb\"><div class=\"doc-actions\"  data-formats-for=\"#totals-that-differ-from-their-parts-as-printed-10sb .table-scroll\" data-file-name=\"totals-that-differ-from-their-parts-as-printed-10sb\"><div class=\"menu\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"action-button menu-toggle\" data-icon=\"copy\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"copy-panel-totals-that-differ-from-their-parts-as-printed-10sb\" aria-label=\"Copy, choose a format\" title=\"Copy\"><svg class=\"menu-toggle__caret\" aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 16 16\"><path d=\"M4 6l4 4 4-4\"/></svg></button><div id=\"copy-panel-totals-that-differ-from-their-parts-as-printed-10sb\" class=\"menu-panel\" hidden><button type=\"button\" data-button-kind=\"menu-item\" data-copy-format=\"text\">Text</button><button type=\"button\" data-button-kind=\"menu-item\" data-copy-format=\"html\">HTML</button><button type=\"button\" data-button-kind=\"menu-item\" data-copy-format=\"markdown\">Markdown</button></div></div><div class=\"menu\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"action-button menu-toggle\" data-icon=\"download\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"download-panel-totals-that-differ-from-their-pa